phpBugTracker "2025" SQLite3 DEMO
=================================

phpBugTracker "2025" includes an demo SQLite3 database ready for use and is 
preloaded with demo accounts, projects, and bug reports.

To try the demo, do this:

  1. Copy config.php-sqlite3-demo-database to config.php
     The config file will use the db/phpbugtracker-demo.sqlite3 database.

     $ cp config.php-sqlite3-demo-database config.php

  2. Edit setperms.sh accordingly and run it: 
     $ vi setperms.sh
     root# bash ./setperms.sh

  3.  Now point your browser to where you installed phpBugTracker:  

         URL http://localhost/path/to/phpbugtracker

When you are ready to do an install for real, delete config.php and
reload the browser and the install will begin.


